508→/// A variable definition: either a static value or a shell-computed value.
509→///
510→/// In YAML, static values are plain strings and computed values use
511→/// `{ command: "..." }` syntax:
512→///
513→/// ```yaml
514→/// vars:
515→///   app_name: "bivvy"                       # static
516→///   version:
517→///     command: "cat VERSION"                 # computed
518→/// ```
